{"seq":4,"slug":"algorithmic-trading","title":"算法交易系统","stage":"DONE","category":"quantitative-finance","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/algorithmic-trading","rating":{"composite":3.83,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.33,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 算法交易系统\n\n算法交易（Algorithmic Trading）是利用计算机程序按照预设的规则和模型自动执行交易决策的技术体系。从 20 世纪 90 年代电子化交易兴起，到如今占据全球股票市场超过 70% 的成交量，算法交易已成为现代金融市场的核心基础设施。\n\n本 Hub 系统性地梳理算法交易的四大支柱：\n\n**交易策略**是算法交易的逻辑内核。动量策略捕捉价格趋势的延续性，均值回归策略利用价格偏离均衡的特征，统计套利则通过多资产间的统计关系获取市场中性收益。每类策略都有其适用的市场环境和风险特征，理解策略背后的金融学原理与统计假设是构建稳健交易系统的起点。\n\n**执行算法**解决\"如何高效地将交易意图转化为市场订单\"的工程问题。TWAP/VWAP 等时间加权算法将大额订单切分为小单以降低市场冲击；实施缺口算法在执行速度与市场影响之间寻找最优平衡；智能订单路由则在多个交易场所之间动态分配订单以获取最优价格。\n\n**系统架构**是策略从研究到生产的桥梁。一个生产级交易系统需要微秒级的事件处理能力、严格的回测框架以避免前视偏差和过拟合、以及多层次的实时风控机制来防范尾部风险。\n\n**高级交易**探索前沿方向：强化学习为动态决策提供新范式，做市策略在提供流动性的同时管理库存风险，加密货币市场则带来 7×24 小时不间断交易的独特挑战与机遇。\n\n本 Hub 面向有一定编程和统计基础的学习者，内容覆盖从经典理论到 2025-2026 年的最新实践。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"trading-strategies","title":"交易策略","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/algorithmic-trading/trading-strategies","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"momentum-strategies","title":"动量与趋势跟踪策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/algorithmic-trading/trading-strategies/momentum-strategies"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mean-reversion","title":"均值回归策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/algorithmic-trading/trading-strategies/mean-reversion"},{"seq":3,"slug":"statistical-arbitrage","title":"统计套利与配对交易","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/algorithmic-trading/trading-strategies/statistical-arbitrage"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"execution-algorithms","title":"执行算法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/algorithmic-trading/execution-algorithms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"twap-vwap","title":"TWAP/VWAP 算法与变体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/algorithmic-trading/execution-algorithms/twap-vwap"},{"seq":2,"slug":"implementation-shortfall","title":"实施缺口与最优执行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/algorithmic-trading/execution-algorithms/implementation-shortfall"},{"seq":3,"slug":"smart-order-routing","title":"智能订单路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/algorithmic-trading/execution-algorithms/smart-order-routing"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"system-architecture","title":"系统架构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/algorithmic-trading/system-architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"trading-system-design","title":"交易系统架构设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/algorithmic-trading/system-architecture/trading-system-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"backtesting-framework","title":"回测框架与偏差控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/algorithmic-trading/system-architecture/backtesting-framework"},{"seq":3,"slug":"risk-controls","title":"实时风控与熔断机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/algorithmic-trading/system-architecture/risk-controls"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"advanced-trading","title":"高级交易","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/algorithmic-trading/advanced-trading","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"reinforcement-learning-trading","title":"强化学习在交易中的应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/algorithmic-trading/advanced-trading/reinforcement-learning-trading"},{"seq":2,"slug":"market-making","title":"做市策略与库存管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/algorithmic-trading/advanced-trading/market-making"},{"seq":3,"slug":"crypto-quant","title":"加密货币量化交易","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/algorithmic-trading/advanced-trading/crypto-quant"}]}]}